{"id":"05e098cce7fb11ad","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-kurtz-open-char.md","title":"Kurtz 随机性的全测度开集刻画","display":"thm-kurtz-open-char — Kurtz 随机性的全测度开集刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-kurtz-open-char","aliases":["43-thm-kurtz-open-char"],"display":"thm-kurtz-open-char — Kurtz 随机性的全测度开集刻画","depends_on":["[[43-df-kurtzrandom]]","[[43-df-effective-open]]","[[43-df-measure]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.5.1 Definition 10.5.1，印刷233，PDF253","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-kurtz-open-char"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-kurtz-open-char</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kurtz-open-char — Kurtz 随机性的全测度开集刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1b1a52dd1295c33c\" href=\"?note=1b1a52dd1295c33c\" title=\"43-df-kurtzrandom\">43-df-kurtzrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" href=\"?note=7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" title=\"43-df-effective-open\">43-df-effective-open</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.5.1 Definition 10.5.1，印刷233，PDF253"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；Kurtz随机性与有效开集见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1b1a52dd1295c33c\" href=\"?note=1b1a52dd1295c33c\" title=\"43-df-kurtzrandom\">43-df-kurtzrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" href=\"?note=7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" title=\"43-df-effective-open\">43-df-effective-open</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 及其定义域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 的公平硬币Borel概率空间。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffectiveOpen}\">\\(\\mathrm{EffectiveOpen}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" href=\"?note=7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" title=\"43-df-effective-open\">43-df-effective-open</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1b1a52dd1295c33c\" href=\"?note=1b1a52dd1295c33c\" title=\"43-df-kurtzrandom\">43-df-kurtzrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveOpen}(U)\\land\\mu(U)=1\\Rightarrow X\\in U\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveOpen}(U)\\land\\mu(U)=1\\Rightarrow X\\in U\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对有效开全测集取补，恰好得到有效闭零集。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.5.1 Definition 10.5.1，印刷233，PDF253。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-kurtzrandom","status":"resolved","id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kurtzrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-open","status":"resolved","id":"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-open]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kurtzrandom","status":"resolved","id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；Kurtz随机性与有效开集见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-effective-open]]，$\\mu$ 及其定义域 $\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 采用 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的公平硬币Borel概率空间。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-open","status":"resolved","id":"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；Kurtz随机性与有效开集见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-effective-open]]，$\\mu$ 及其定义域 $\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 采用 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的公平硬币Borel概率空间。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；Kurtz随机性与有效开集见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-effective-open]]，$\\mu$ 及其定义域 $\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 采用 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的公平硬币Borel概率空间。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-open","status":"resolved","id":"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EffectiveOpen}$ 是 $\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-effective-open]]。\n$\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kurtzrandom","status":"resolved","id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EffectiveOpen}$ 是 $\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-effective-open]]。\n$\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EffectiveOpen}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveOpen}(U)\\land\\mu(U)=1\\Rightarrow X\\in U\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1430,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-210","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-kurtz-open-char]] — Kurtz 随机性的全测度开集刻画"}],"outgoing":["1b1a52dd1295c33c","7d3f8d3dfdb54f27","8e999d59227f4a28","ab1ef7b1cac112c1"]}